  "stakes": {
    "do": "Read the trunk. Notices, brands and warnings, including a fresh one about Amos Ketch's crew that Hallie Brandt is taking down as you ride up.",
    "lose": "Nothing by standing here, which is the custom. Everything you say here travels, though, because this is where the county's word changes hands.",
    "decide": "What to nail up yourself, and whether the warning about Ketch stays on the trunk or comes down."
  },
  "art_gap": "Reads as ordinary timber. The one enormous storm-split live oak the whole place is named for does not exist: there are nine identical ordinary trees instead. One big-tree sprite would do more for this location than anything else on this list."
